<ContentLayout title="Privacy Policy | TokenCalculator.dev" description="TokenCalculator.dev privacy policy and local-processing commitment." heading="Privacy policy"><p>Your prompt, files, and images are processed in your browser and are not uploaded to TokenCalculator.dev. The application has no account system or content database.</p><h2>Local files</h2><p>Document text and image dimensions exist only in the active browser session. Clearing the page removes them.</p><h2>Hosting logs</h2><p>The hosting provider may retain standard request metadata such as IP address, requested page, and browser user agent. User content is never part of those page requests.</p></ContentLayout>
